      "text": "  rule filterLoopBody\n    => If(Compare(Name(\"substring\"), CmpOp(\"in\", Name(\"string\"))),\n          Expr(Call(Attribute(Name(\"result\"), \"append\"), Name(\"string\"))) .Stmts,\n          .Stmts)"
