      "start_line": 67,
      "text": "  rule filterBody\n    => Assign(Name(\"result\"), ListExpr(.Exprs))\n       For(Name(\"string\"), Name(\"strings\"), filterLoopBody)\n       Return(Name(\"result\"))"
